Subject: [PATCH 365/403] Core: --gui-script runs a script that needs the GUI
 without a screen

FreeCADCmd --gui-script work.py -- args: a child starts the GUI
offscreen and runs the script with its output on stdout (the GUI took
print into its report view), its exception with the traceback and exit
code 1, and files opened hidden (a 3D view needs OpenGL: endless GL
errors and nothing done). Company test 0.7.9.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
